  m_text: "- Upload a PDF of your choice to generate questions out of.\n\n- Choose
    to either play the Turn-Based Quiz Game or generate\n  flashcards\n\n- Choose
    between Easy (True or False), Medium (Multiple Choice),\n  or Hard (Identification)
    questions.\n\n- Answer before the timer runs out, your damage an score \n  will
    depend on how fast you answer.\n\nEasy:\t\t1 to 40 damage\nMedium:\t\t1 to 30
    damage\nHard:\t\t1 to 20 damage"
